<rss xmlns:ns0="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>的 bilibili 空间</title><link>https://space.bilibili.com/3493141581662406</link><ns0:link href="http://rss.wudifeixue.com/bilibili/user/video/3493141581662406" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /><description>的 bilibili 空间 - Made with love by RSSHub(https://github.com/DIYgod/RSSHub)</description><generator>RSSHub</generator><webMaster>i@diygod.me (DIYgod)</webMaster><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 18:36:12 GMT</lastBuildDate><ttl>5</ttl><item><title>行走群山的憋宝行当，宝物自有高下之分。天灵地宝，草货为下，唯有年岁久远的中灵草，勉强算作半件地宝。走进神龙阴坡雾林，揭秘憋宝人芦头数痕，狮盘辨岁的识草...</title><description>&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=117091847900537&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/72f82d03d07124d24b24afd69efe144787cc7eb0.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iKgA6wEiZ</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iKgA6wEiZ</guid><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路龙神顶30天（25）重返文明 拆阱收尽山中局，炙肉辞别龙神巅</title><description>&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=117075574064798&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5c3e4b9cdf1bddf797be34e135be3127873ac97a.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1eTuB6sEse</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1eTuB6sEse</guid><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 09:20:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路 龙神顶篇（24）煮梨敛涩作朝炊 遍览空阱撷岩桂 行路忽逢山野珍 香辛慢炖腴脂味</title><description>&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=117064417214676&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5c52faa0731ed0527184ce45dcb1040f4ff270e5.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wWu16oEQy</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wWu16oEQy</guid><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路龙神篇（23）陷阱无所获，巡山尝百果，梨香猕桃酸</title><description>&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=117053159900660&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/cbcf5e806c563e8f6bb6844a173fe5526893f902.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MJub6WEf8</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MJub6WEf8</guid><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 10:20:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路龙神篇（22）桂卤绝味鼠片 机关遍布查收获，鸡鸣参补卤飘香</title><description>高海拔挑战龙神顶生存30天，逐个检查前日布下的陷阱，做一锅桂卤绝味鼠片补身！&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=117041818307189&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7f8c0253e9a423016caf51b11705c4ada2705785.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1HDMk6mEQK</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1HDMk6mEQK</guid><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 07:56:57 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路龙神篇（21）韭菜炒熏鼠肉</title><description>阴雨连绵栖野舍，粮仓将尽待新获。晴开布阱寻山味，韭炒熏肉溢野香。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=117025108198233&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5fa21534d1d904765721e0668aba900a6d57182b.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1pq3R6dEkj</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1pq3R6dEkj</guid><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 09:20:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>杀青宴 石击寒溪收细鳞 直播预告 明晚九点党参奉上！</title><description>即将拍新片，结绳侯雉鸡，石击冷水鱼，明宵赠党参。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=117013380860692&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/790194234a6ebe11b8fe3c8f362395b1471bc343.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1M6GA6dEWf</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1M6GA6dEWf</guid><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 09:05:29 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路龙神篇（20）阱断兽逃</title><description>阱断走脱山中兽，巡山遍览千般迹。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=117002811214481&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/3d825392c7a9664f5f7224c7847c39b33b67cab7.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1J1316bEyF</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1J1316bEyF</guid><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 10:44:35 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路 龙神篇（19）熏肉炖百合王</title><description>巡山晓暮寻灵草，野果充饥绕野冈。掘得经年百合株，芳花慢炖腊鲜香。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116990496803425&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5cf4f115b3e094e5bb2a13048be668560449a0c3.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MWgZ6uEAn</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MWgZ6uEAn</guid><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 09:20:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路 龙神篇（18）</title><description>熊逐仓皇遗履，朝编藤屣徐行。途逢四叶仙参，阱获山鼠烹蝉。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116974055063729&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/cf054c326be675aa4a7c68e47f4a61e93e1f34a6.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Boga6SEvQ</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Boga6SEvQ</guid><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 09:20:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路 龙神篇（17）</title><description>夜捕金蝉盛满釜，潜塘掩息避熊追。百年灵已落袋，师叔千里湖南归。憋宝完整版发布之时，就是抽30-60年老参之日。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116967562283705&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/c05c757ee87d8ae9658d000be2d3bb2cdc99fffb.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1q8gS6wEtn</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1q8gS6wEtn</guid><pubDate>Thu, 23 Jul 2026 05:21:16 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路 龙神篇（16）</title><description>小时候总爱上山摸知了，现在山里撸串幸福感直接拉满！有没有馋到你？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116963468642382&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/15eebb7c21894a1679476a0dbec24c9728d2486d.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yAgC6xEE8</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yAgC6xEE8</guid><pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 11:51:19 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>《求生之路》龙神顶篇</title><description>食来天地皆同力，半夜醒来食物足。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116943839299126&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ced1dcee09df502cba51deb5f2d20bb0604c12b6.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jeKi67EaL</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jeKi67EaL</guid><pubDate>Sun, 19 Jul 2026 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路 龙神篇（14）品参</title><description>晨炊山药烘橘干，浅撷山参踏霞还。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116933789746288&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/19823e58b333bf81575393f50c1870780f84d6f7.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1JcKH6CEcN</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1JcKH6CEcN</guid><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 09:15:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路 龙神篇（13）</title><description>野果山药饱饥肠，党参成群待归期。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116922666518492&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7cb6f8f5609c5d45826c54102f593aff2ac732f0.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1EENv61EmJ</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1EENv61EmJ</guid><pubDate>Wed, 15 Jul 2026 09:20:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路 龙神篇（12）</title><description>曝得黄精九蒸晒，山野果椒脆皮来。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116911073462181&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/22f6728fe99b447499cedeb046426db17457870a.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1huNC69En5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1huNC69En5</guid><pubDate>Mon, 13 Jul 2026 09:20:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路 龙神篇（11）麻辣香锅</title><description>循迹查穴得玉兔，椒韭辣蓼香满庐。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116899178349079&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/2a8cd47d85fbd2bfb73a8c46d044dd1cd5741486.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wXNW6XEqn</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wXNW6XEqn</guid><pubDate>Sat, 11 Jul 2026 09:20:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路 神农篇</title><description>冒雨半山挖粮道，野果垫肚不心焦，山药七八斤，黄精一篮笑，蒸熟一锅今晚饱。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116888742988228&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/960c2e5a906a3e5b6ee0f71eead2d87e013ce96a.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cQMJ6UEp6</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cQMJ6UEp6</guid><pubDate>Thu, 09 Jul 2026 10:55:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路 神农篇</title><description>神龙顶求生第九日，破晓风云急，山顶卷寒雨，晨起查肉食，尽数空。索性下山腰，收获丰。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116876260672553&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/edc39f78b4a1fc58642bcf39f9651d5114a8e004.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cWMx6wEPK</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cWMx6wEPK</guid><pubDate>Tue, 07 Jul 2026 04:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路 龙神篇</title><description>龙神顶求生第九日，雾雨巡山现药草，老冬根深藿也茂。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116871328171973&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/e18b78732ca4648599f90c5b82bbea9bcc0607fa.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1CXTS6vEmg</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1CXTS6vEmg</guid><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 09:20:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路 龙神篇</title><description>搓藤作火熏鼠窟，炖肉一锅香入骨。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116859869334325&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/d67537084f2446a630cd9efe813b230afe716c30.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xmMc6BEXn</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xmMc6BEXn</guid><pubDate>Sat, 04 Jul 2026 09:05:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>《求生之路》龙神篇6</title><description>起床煮茶开了场，搭个柴房拾柴忙。挖寻黄精进山岗。鼠迹忽现泥土上，炖碗黄精喷喷香。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116850474158591&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/b1ce72a4968977622458a6efec0af2ec3f0790fe.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12bTE6DEyC</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12bTE6DEyC</guid><pubDate>Thu, 02 Jul 2026 12:58:58 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>番外篇 抓黄鳝攻略</title><description>闷了十来天，喊上老表搞黄鳝，它滑我不慌，一抓一个准。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116843176135009&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/73be3f6f60cdef38fb8fb2c6927b56e865d4f624.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV132TY6iEUF</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV132TY6iEUF</guid><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 09:20:05 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路 龙神篇6</title><description>编筐采得百合香，熏桂备柴卧云乡。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116826247794095&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/89aae893962f402ad0b18b8afbe5602ea8914921.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1JJTK6uEDp</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1JJTK6uEDp</guid><pubDate>Sun, 28 Jun 2026 09:20:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路 龙神篇5</title><description>朝采松膜作晨粮，钻燧得火照寒房，削木为榻歇疲身，百合满锅慰饥肠。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116815661368988&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/562f2330b30806b3d8e6d2332db48be94803c758.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1sh756FE3u</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1sh756FE3u</guid><pubDate>Fri, 26 Jun 2026 09:28:29 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路 龙神篇4</title><description>雾大修墙松枝遮，挖通烟道刨百合。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116803866987934&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/0d9ad5ea4fe94a5bb8c57626baaf03e4a1e7bfd4.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Tbjd6UES7</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Tbjd6UES7</guid><pubDate>Wed, 24 Jun 2026 09:20:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路 龙神篇3</title><description>早上雾散出太阳，找柴晾上编鞋忙，大雨一来全湿光，架枝削皮捂身上&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116786888444447&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/407ab46054bc014b2a020a6db19b04fb5a4d8c37.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ZFjb6XE7E</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ZFjb6XE7E</guid><pubDate>Sun, 21 Jun 2026 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>求生之路 龙神篇2</title><description>龙神架顶启征程，雾锁云台觅水行，斫木编茅起庐帐，且卧云巅待晓晴！&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116770178468477&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/9f07f44fe58fd6a7c4413e51df5ac7328e9c7a70.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1thjc6fE7s</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1thjc6fE7s</guid><pubDate>Thu, 18 Jun 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>荒野生存挑战30天</title><description>本次30天荒野生存挑战龙神篇，正片开始！三浪15号求生归来，剪辑好后稳定更新本季，敬请期待！&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116741388633177&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ed685065693da40a1e5e3efd726261899c0bec8e.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VqJE6bELr</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VqJE6bELr</guid><pubDate>Sat, 13 Jun 2026 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>神农架序章</title><description>新的冒险即将开启 老表送行出发神农架 深山松针藏枞菌 一口鲜到骨子里&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116724410090014&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/fd427e3dda90e36d4a427e6a65297bd986ccc7bf.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV16FER6iEnk</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV16FER6iEnk</guid><pubDate>Wed, 10 Jun 2026 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>